"markdown": "### DarkIcon\n\nAn advanced icon customization and wallpaper darkening tool for iOS 15 to iOS 18. The tweak brings a comprehensive Dark Mode look that automatically follows the system for the Home Screen, Folders and the Spotlight search bar.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/DarkIcon/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/DarkIcon/Screenshots/2.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/DarkIcon/Screenshots/3.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 3"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/DarkIcon/Screenshots/4.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 4"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 8,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Smart wallpaper darkening:** Automatically adjusts Home Screen and Lock Screen wallpaper dimming on iOS 16–18 based on image brightness, with manual intensity adjustment.\n- **Synced icon appearance:** Automatically applies Dark Mode to icons on the Home Screen, Folders and Spotlight (fully supported on iOS 15–17).\n- **Diverse icon styles:** Independently choose Original, Dark, Clear or Tinted styles separately for Light and Dark modes.\n- **Flexible processing algorithms:** Supports Hybrid, Apple and Chroma modes to smoothly optimize app icons while preserving the details and main colors of the subject.\n- **High-performance cache:** A disk cache combined with a 64MB hot-cache reduces read/write load, speeds up scrolling and saves maximum battery.\n- **Extended customization:** Supports manual image import from Library/Files, managing an exception list that skips Dark Icon, plus a customization panel directly on iOS 16/17/18.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
